  "limitations": [
    "Source capture is bounded UTF-8 text, not arbitrary binary recovery.",
    "A common envelope pass does not validate domain semantics or schema-version support.",
    "Schema migration remains explicitly unsupported until a reviewed transform contract exists.",
    "Realtime collaboration is a later scope; initial release still includes React/RN/Swift/Android.",
    "Catalog structural validation enforces known fields only; unresolved types, registry document bodies and external library versions remain unverified.",
    "The domain profile covers only ADR-0012 types/content; remaining type categories and full semantic execution stay unverified.",
    "Project bundles restore the same identity into an empty store; independent-copy retargeting and asset/dependency transport remain separate.",
    "Browser storage evidence is bounded to Chromium; physical quota, power loss, eviction, Safari/Firefox and collaborative merge remain unverified."
  ]
